## Next Steps

The analytics integration is complete and ready to track page views once deployed to Vercel. No additional configuration changes are needed.

To activate analytics tracking:
1. Deploy the application to Vercel using `vercel deploy`
2. Analytics will automatically start collecting data on the Vercel platform

